  "page": 23,
  "quote": "The crushed product will be stockpiled before entering the grinding circuit, which will include a SAG mill, ball mill, and hydrocyclones for particle size classification. The ground product will feed the lead rougher flotation circuit. The lead rougher concentrate will proceed to a classification and regrind circuit, followed by three cleaner flotation stages and a cleaner-scavenger stage. The final lead concentrate will be thickened, filtered and bagged for shipment. The lead rougher tails and cleaner-scavenger tails will feed the zinc rougher flotation circuit. The zinc rougher concentrate will follow a similar regrind and cleaning process, including three cleaning stages and a cleaner-scavenger stage. The final zinc concentrate will be thickened, filtered, and stockpiled for shipment."
 },
